Package: naxp
Title: Encoded ASCII Expressions for Structured Text Codes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tim", "Gordon", , "tim.gordon@btinternet.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-3087-4384"))
Description: Implements naxp, the standard encoding of ASCII text as unsigned
    integers <https://naxp.org/spec/>. A naxp is written in a syntax like
    that of regular expressions. It encodes each text it accepts, such as a
    postcode, as an integer from 1 to a fixed maximum, and decodes each
    integer back to a canonical form of the text. Wraps the naxp 'C++'
    library.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://naxp.org/, https://github.com/logmu-org/r-naxp,
    https://r-naxp.logmu.org/
BugReports: https://github.com/logmu-org/r-naxp/issues
